WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.040
SCP-096 Vs SCP-3660. Would the terrifying,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:09.840
mass-murdering Shy Guy finally meet its match&nbsp;
at the hands of the Zoo Zipper, an object that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:15.040
when placed on any living entity, will slowly&nbsp;
open them up and reveal the animal within?

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:22.400
Honestly, it’s hard to say. When 3660 was used&nbsp;
on SCP-682, the resulting gecko ultimately became&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:28.960
just as deadly as the monster itself, and SCP-096&nbsp;
is at a similar level of destructive power.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:33.440
Perhaps, if the zoo zipper was&nbsp;
used on SCP-096, it’d open up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.920
revealing a spindly-limbed Spider Monkey within,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:41.200
just as eager to kill anyone who dares see its&nbsp;
face. Or, at the very least, throw poop at them.

